## Interface: 16001
## Title: Hunt Target
## Notes: A nameplate-style Hunt plate: click it and type mob names; your Hunt key then targets the nearest one, marks it with a skull and uses your chosen ability (Charge, Shoot, or your own). A hunted mob nearby pops up in a little unit frame above it. Move it in Edit Mode.
